"""Global/DocumentIncrementTable (inflated) of Revit 2016-2023 family files (4-byte element id formats): the list of document increments (save history) Revit expects to find in an old-format file; user names replaced by filler of the same length (own analysis of the layout; table taken from Revit-written sample families)."""
import base64, zlib
_B64 = {
    2016: '',
    2017: '',
    2018: '',
    2019: '',
    2020: '',
    2021: '',
    2022: '',
    2023: '',
}
DIT_BY_FORMAT = {str(y): zlib.decompress(base64.b64decode(v)) for y, v in _B64.items()}
